# Draconautics Engineer (2/2): "Exhaust — {3}{R}: Create a 4/4 red Dinosaur Dragon creature token with flying" and, separately, "Exhaust — {R}: Other
# creatures you control gain haste until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Each exhaust ability is used once, independently.
# Turn 3: with three Moxen (3 mana) the {3}{R} ability is refused; with a fourth (exactly {3}{R}) it is paid and the pool is empty after, and a 4/4
# red flying Dinosaur Dragon token appears (CR 111.1). Turn 5 (the {3}{R} ability spent): the {R} ability still works - the token gets haste (not Bot2's
# Ornithopter, which Bot1 does not control, nor the Engineer itself) and the Engineer grows to 3/3.

